libltc: libltc (Linear/Logitudinal Time Code (LTC) Library)
libltc:
libltc: Linear (or Longitudinal) Timecode (LTC) is an encoding of
libltc: timecode data as a Manchester-Biphase encoded audio signal.
libltc: The audio signal is commonly recorded on a VTR track or other
libltc: storage media.
libltc: libltc provides functionality to encode and decode LTC from/to
libltc: timecode, including SMPTE date support.
